<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="PHM" style="id">FLM - Sefwi New Testament</book>
  <para style="h">Filemon</para>
  <para style="toc3">Flm</para>
  <para style="toc2">Filemon</para>
  <para style="toc1">FILEMON</para>
  <para style="mt4">ƆFA MANE</para>
  <para style="mt1">FILEMON</para>
  <para style="ip">Ngrataa bɔ honhom hane Paul maa ɔhworɔle namukoraati, Filemon yeɛ ɔte sii koraa ɔ. Sɔ krataa he de, ɔhworɔ mane ye damvo Filemon kɔyɛ 60-61 Y.A.<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:0 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Y.A kyire Yesu Aberɛ so (Brɔfo: </char><char style="it">Common Era</char> anaa <char style="it">C.E</char>)</note> Né Filemon te Kolose bɔ ɔwɔ Asia Kamba ne. (<char style="xt"><ref loc="PHM 1:1">Flm 1:1</ref>, <ref loc="PHM 1:2">2</ref></char>.) Ɛkora nwu kyɛ Paul yeɛ ɔbokale Filemon maa ɔɔyɛle Kristoniɛ ɔ, (<char style="xt"><ref loc="PHM 1:19">Flm 1:19</ref></char>) na ebia ne Filemon le sikaa kaa. Né ole akoaa, afei koso, ye awuro yeɛ ne asafo ne yia nu ɔ. Nikye kõ bɔ ne ɔmaa bɛse Filemon paa yeɛ ole ɔdɔ bɔ ole ye, ɔne ɛwɔfoɛ bɔ ne odɛ́ bɛ ne.—<char style="xt"><ref loc="PHM 1:1">Flm 1:1</ref>, <ref loc="PHM 1:2">2</ref>, <ref loc="PHM 1:7">7</ref></char>.</para>
  <para style="ip">Né Paul fa sɔ krataa he siesie edwirɛ bie wɔ Filemon ne ye akoaa Onesimus afia. Né Onesimus anwati afi ye wura nanwo, na oofitele Paul berɛ wɔ Roman. Paul hane nzɛmba ne hyirele Onesimus maa ɔɔyɛle Kristoniɛ. Né Filemon le ye nwo atee kyɛ ɔtwe ye akoaa ne so paa, nakoso Paul fale sɔ krataa he srɛle ye kyɛ ofi y'ahone nu le ye bieku. Paul anhyɛ Filemon, na mmom ɔsrɛle ye kyɛ oliema bɔ ɔdɔ ye. (<char style="xt"><ref loc="PHM 1:8">Flm 1:8</ref>, <ref loc="PHM 1:9">9</ref>, <ref loc="PHM 1:14-17">14-17</ref></char>) Ɛkora nwu kyɛ Paul bɔbɔ yeɛ ɔhworɔle krataa he ɔ, ofikyɛ ɔhane ye wɔ nu fa srɛ mane Onesimus.—<char style="xt"><ref loc="PHM 1:19">Flm 1:19</ref>.</char></para>
  <para style="ip">Sɔ krataa he maa yɛnwu nningyein biemɔ yɛfa tete Kristofoɛ nemɔ nwo. Ebie yeɛ ole kyɛ:</para>
  <para style="ipi">• Né beyia nu wɔ aliemaa mɔ awuro nu (<char style="xt"><ref loc="PHM 1:2">Flm 1:2</ref></char>);</para>
  <para style="ipi">• Né bɛfrɛ bɛ nwo aliemaa. (<char style="xt"><ref loc="PHM 1:1">Flm 1:1</ref>, <ref loc="PHM 1:2">2</ref>, <ref loc="PHM 1:7">7</ref>, <ref loc="PHM 1:20">20</ref></char>);</para>
  <para style="ipi">• Né bɛbɔ mbaeɛ bɛma bɛ nwo. (<char style="xt"><ref loc="PHM 1:4">Flm 1:4</ref>, <ref loc="PHM 1:22">22</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="ipi">• Na ne ebiala sua nikye fi gyidie ne ɔdɔ bɔ ye mmango le ye nanu. (<char style="xt"><ref loc="PHM 1:5-7">Flm 1:5-7</ref>.</char>)</para>
  <para style="ib" />
  <para style="iot">ENU DWIRƐ</para>
  <para style="io1">Ngyeaa (<char style="xt"><ref loc="PHM 1:1-3">1:1-3</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">Ɔdɔ ne gyidie bɔ Filemon le ye (<char style="xt"><ref loc="PHM 1:4-7">1:4-7</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">Paul srɛ mane Onesimus (<char style="xt"><ref loc="PHM 1:8-22">1:8-22</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">Edwirɛ bɔ ɔpɛ yebo (<char style="xt"><ref loc="PHM 1:23-25">1:23-25</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="ib" />
  <para style="ie" />
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="PHM 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHM 1:1" />Me Paul, bɔ Kristo Yesu ti nna prizin, mene Timoteo,</para>
  <para style="m" vid="PHM 1:1">yɛfa krataa he yɛbrɛ yɛ dɔfo Filemon, bɔ ɔte yɛ mmango bɔ yɛne ye yɛ adwuma ne, <verse eid="PHM 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHM 1:2" />ɔne yɛliema brasua Apia, ne yɛ mmango sogyaniɛ Arkipo, yeɛ asafo bɔ beyia nu wɔ w'awuro berɛ ne:<verse eid="PHM 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHM 1:3" />Adom ne asomdwie bɔ ofi yɛ Baba Nyameɛ, ne y'Awurade Yesu Kristo berɛ ha ɛmɔ.<verse eid="PHM 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHM 1:4" />Mmerɛ biala bɔ ngɔbɔ mbaeɛ ngɔma wɔ ne, meda Nyameɛ ase, <verse eid="PHM 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHM 1:5" />ofikyɛ gyidie bɔ ele ye wɔ Awurade Yesu nu, ɔne ɔdɔ bɔ ele ye ma akrongronfoɛ ne, daa mete ye nwo dwirɛ. <verse eid="PHM 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHM 1:6" />Me mbaeɛ yeɛ ole kyɛ gyidie bɔ ɛne afoforɛ le ye nati, ekole nikye pa biala bɔ Kristo ti yɛle ye ne kɔto nu. <verse eid="PHM 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHM 1:7" />Nniema, wɔ dɔ bɔ ndele ye nwo dwirɛ ne maa me nye gyele na m'ahone tɔle me kunu, ofikyɛ amaa akrongronfoɛ ne nwo adwo bɛ.<verse eid="PHM 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHM 1:8" />Yeti ɔwɔ nu, Kristo ti ahaa ngɔhora ngɔha ye pen kyɛ ɛyɛ nikye pa, <verse eid="PHM 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHM 1:9" />nakoso, ɔdɔ ti, mepena kyɛ mesrɛ wɔ. Ofikyɛ me Paul, kesaalae mayɛ aworowaa, na Kristo Yesu ti, nna prizin. <verse eid="PHM 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHM 1:10" />Mesrɛ mema m'akwalaa Onesimus bɔ maayɛ ye baba wɔ prizin wa ne. <verse eid="PHM 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHM 1:11" />Mmerɛ bie bɔ wapɛ nu ne de, né mvasoɛ biala nne ye so mma wɔ, nakoso kesaalae de, ye nwo awa mvasoɛ ama me ne wɔ. <verse eid="PHM 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHM 1:12" />Na mema osa ba wɔ berɛ, ɔte sona bɔ ɔla m'ahone so.<verse eid="PHM 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHM 1:13" />Ɔhale me ngome a, ahaa ɔkɔtena me nwo wa na wasi wɔ gya nu wasõ me mmerɛ bɔ nzɛmba nati nna prizin ne. <verse eid="PHM 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHM 1:14" />Nakoso menguro kyɛ mefa wɔ si meyɛ nikye fee, né wɔanyɛ kyɛ mehyɛ wɔ maa ɛyɛ nikye pa; na mmom mepena kyɛ ofi w'ahone nu. <verse eid="PHM 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHM 1:15" />Ebia, ɛhe ati yeɛ ofili wɔ nwo kaa ne, na wamaa wɔ sa aha ye koraa, <verse eid="PHM 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHM 1:16" />sɔ mmerɛ he de, ɔtte akoaa mbaen, mmom ɔtra akoaa, eliema bɔ ɛdɔ ye. Ɔte ebie bɔ medɔ ye paa, nakoso wɔ de, ɔtra sɔ koraa wɔ anwoɔnaen nu ne Awurade nu.<verse eid="PHM 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHM 1:17" />Yeti, sɛ nde wɔ damvo de a, ye de, dɛ́ ye kama, kyɛbɔ ahaa ekole me nala. <verse eid="PHM 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHM 1:18" />Sɛ wayɛ wɔ bɔne, anaa ɔma wɔ kerɛ bie a, bu kerɛ ne ma me. <verse eid="PHM 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHM 1:19" />Me Paul yeɛ mefa me sa metworɔ ɛhe ne: <char style="em">Ngotua ngɔma wɔ</char>. Wɔ po, nnaa ɛkaye kyɛ kerɛ bɔ ɛma me, sana ɛfa wɔ nipadua namu ma me. <verse eid="PHM 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHM 1:20" />Nniema, ma nya wɔ so mvasoɛ bie wɔ Awurade nu, kyekye me wora wɔ Kristo nu.<verse eid="PHM 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHM 1:21" />Medɛ́ medi kyɛ ekotie me, yeti yeɛ metworɔ krataa he mebrɛ wɔ ne, na mese kyɛ bɔ mesrɛ ne, ɛkɔyɛ maa ɔkɔbo sɔ koraa. <verse eid="PHM 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PHM 1:22" />Afei koso, pena sua ma me, na medɛ́ medi kyɛ ɛmɔ mbaeɛ ti, bɛkɔyakyi me maa ngɔwa ɛmɔ berɛ.<verse eid="PHM 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PHM 1:23" />Epafra, me damvo bɔ Kristo Yesu ti ye koso ɔla prizin ne nwa ɔkyea wɔ, <verse eid="PHM 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PHM 1:24" />na sɔ ala yeɛ Marko, Aristarko, Dema, ne Luka bɔ mene bɛ yɛ adwuma ne nwa bɛkyea wɔ.<verse eid="PHM 1:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PHM 1:25" />Awurade Yesu Kristo adom boka ɛmɔ so, mmerɛ bɔ ɛmɔda suban pa ali ne.<verse eid="PHM 1:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PHM 1" />
</usx>